'''Brutal blue dragons''' are a tougher version of [[blue dragon]]s and can be killed as an alternative for a blue dragon [[Slayer task]]. They can be found in the [[Catacombs of Kourend]] and [[Ruins of Tapoyauik]].

Players can access the dragons by running west through the Catacombs of Kourend or alternatively, use the {{Map|type=maplink|text=hole|mtype=circle|r=4|1563,3791}} found in [[Lovakengj]] to take them there immediately (unlocking this shortcut requires climbing up the vine from inside the catacombs first). They can also be found in the Ruins of Tapoyauik, easily accessed by using the [[Pendant of Ates]] after completion of [[The Heart of Darkness]] and activating the obelisk outside the ruins.

Like all [[brutal dragon]]s, they use [[Melee]], [[Magic]] and long-range [[dragonfire]]. Using both [[Protect from Magic]] and an [[antifire potion]] will completely protect players from their dragonfire and magic attacks, and they can be [[Safespot|safespotted]] this way if not standing within melee range.

